        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roundabout, AC base layer, 30% recycling</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundabout, AC base layer, 30% recycling
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: e6972fa0-aa08-406c-8f2b-5fc637d4d8ad
This dataset documents the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of 1 m2 AC base layer for a roundabout in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Layer thickness 80 mm, service life 40 years. 30 % recycling content
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e6972fa0-aa08-406c-8f2b-5fc637d4d8ad.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
